// (just run, just failed); the hint names `--interp` (the actual remedy).
$ karac run --interp examples/db_pipeline/src/main.kara   # correct rows, exit 0
// src/cli.rs:5036 Err arm => eprintln + hint + process::exit(1). No fallback.
