    as above                                                   LEAK 602 B / 4
    `if let Some(x) = cur.get("n")` instead of `match`          LEAK 602 B / 4  (form irrelevant)
    3 elements in a loop, same body                            LEAK 1806 B / 12 (linear: 602/elem)
    `match vms[0].get("n")` -- INLINE index, no `let`           clean
    `let cur = vms[i]; cur.len()` -- no `.get()`                clean
